---
// src/components/CodebaseEntropyLoopDiagram.astro
---

<div class="ent-loop">
  <div class="ent-loop__desktop">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 880 440"
      class="ent-loop__svg"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    >
      <defs>
        <pattern
          id="entropy-grid-pattern"
          width="20"
          height="20"
          patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
        >
          <circle cx="2" cy="2" r="1" class="ent-grid-dot" opacity="0.4"
          ></circle>
        </pattern>
        <linearGradient
          id="entropy-left-grad"
          x1="0%"
          y1="0%"
          x2="100%"
          y2="100%"
        >
          <stop offset="0%" class="ent-stop-red" stop-opacity="0.12"></stop>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#f97316" stop-opacity="0.04"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
        <linearGradient
          id="entropy-right-grad"
          x1="0%"
          y1="0%"
          x2="100%"
          y2="100%"
        >
          <stop offset="0%" class="ent-stop-sky" stop-opacity="0.18"></stop>
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8b5cf6" stop-opacity="0.08"></stop>
        </linearGradient>
        <marker
          id="arrow-entropy-del"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="6"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="6"
          markerHeight="6"
          orient="auto-start-reverse"
        >
          <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="ent-arrow-head--red"></path>
        </marker>
        <marker
          id="arrow-entropy-deep"
          viewBox="0 0 10 10"
          refX="6"
          refY="5"
          markerWidth="6"
          markerHeight="6"
          orient="auto-start-reverse"
        >
          <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" class="ent-arrow-head--sky"></path>
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Background Card -->
      <rect width="880" height="440" rx="12" class="ent-panel"></rect>
      <rect width="880" height="440" rx="12" fill="url(#entropy-grid-pattern)"
      ></rect>

      <!-- Left: The Entropy Trap (Shallow Modules & Big Ball of Mud) -->
      <g transform="translate(30, 24)">
        <rect
          width="380"
          height="392"
          rx="10"
          fill="url(#entropy-left-grad)"
          class="ent-stroke--red"
          stroke-width="1.2"
          stroke-dasharray="4 4"></rect>

        <rect
          x="20"
          y="20"
          width="160"
          height="26"
          rx="6"
          class="ent-fill--red"
          opacity="0.2"></rect>
        <text
          x="30"
          y="38"
          class="ent-text--red"
          font-size="12"
          font-weight="bold">AI 時代的大泥球陷阱</text
        >
        <text x="20" y="70" class="ent-text--muted" font-size="12"
          >Vibe Coding 加速累積的淺層傳遞代碼</text
        >

        <!-- Shallow Pass-through Cluster -->
        <g transform="translate(20, 95)">
          <rect
            class="ent-card ent-stroke--red-soft"
            width="340"
            height="70"
            rx="8"
            stroke-width="1"></rect>
          <text
            x="16"
            y="24"
            class="ent-text--red-title"
            font-size="12"
            font-weight="bold">淺層模組 (Shallow Pass-through)</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="44" class="ent-text--muted" font-size="11.5"
            >只轉發參數的冗餘 Wrapper / Service</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="60" class="ent-text--red" font-size="11"
            >表面積龐大，無封裝價值（Interface ≈ Body）</text
          >
        </g>

        <path
          d="M 190 165 L 190 185"
          class="ent-stroke--red"
          stroke-width="1.5"
          stroke-dasharray="2 2"
          marker-end="url(#arrow-entropy-del)"></path>

        <g transform="translate(20, 190)">
          <rect
            class="ent-card ent-stroke--red"
            width="340"
            height="65"
            rx="8"
            stroke-width="1"></rect>
          <text
            x="16"
            y="24"
            class="ent-text--red-title"
            font-size="12"
            font-weight="bold">刪除測試失敗 (Deletion Test Fails)</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="46" class="ent-text--muted" font-size="11.5"
            >「刪除此模組，複雜度直接消失，呼叫端無痛」</text
          >
        </g>

        <path
          d="M 190 255 L 190 275"
          class="ent-stroke--red"
          stroke-width="1.5"
          stroke-dasharray="2 2"
          marker-end="url(#arrow-entropy-del)"></path>

        <g transform="translate(20, 280)">
          <rect
            class="ent-card--red ent-stroke--red"
            width="340"
            height="85"
            rx="8"
            stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
          <text
            x="16"
            y="24"
            class="ent-text--red"
            font-size="12.5"
            font-weight="bold">熵增終局：認知超載</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="48" class="ent-text--body" font-size="11.5"
            >✕ 程式碼行數暴增 10 倍，實質功能零提升</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="68" class="ent-text--body" font-size="11.5"
            >✕ 下一個 Agent 迷失在空洞包裝中無從下手</text
          >
        </g>
      </g>

      <!-- Right: Architecture Entropy Reduction Loop -->
      <g transform="translate(470, 24)">
        <rect
          width="380"
          height="392"
          rx="10"
          fill="url(#entropy-right-grad)"
          class="ent-stroke--sky"
          stroke-width="1.5"></rect>

        <rect
          x="20"
          y="20"
          width="180"
          height="26"
          rx="6"
          class="ent-fill--sky"
          opacity="0.2"></rect>
        <text
          x="30"
          y="38"
          class="ent-text--sky"
          font-size="12"
          font-weight="bold">架構除熵迴圈 (Entropy Loop)</text
        >
        <text x="20" y="70" class="ent-text--muted" font-size="12"
          >架構師作為邊界審查者與模組加深引導</text
        >

        <!-- Step 1: Automated Deletion Test -->
        <g transform="translate(20, 95)">
          <rect
            class="ent-card ent-stroke--sky"
            width="340"
            height="65"
            rx="8"
            stroke-width="1"></rect>
          <text
            x="16"
            y="24"
            class="ent-text--sky"
            font-size="12"
            font-weight="bold">1. 刪除測試審查 (The Deletion Test)</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="46" class="ent-text--muted" font-size="11.5"
            >主動辨識零槓桿模組，無情拔除或合併</text
          >
        </g>

        <path
          d="M 190 160 L 190 180"
          class="ent-stroke--sky"
          stroke-width="1.8"
          marker-end="url(#arrow-entropy-deep)"></path>

        <!-- Step 2: Deepening Workflow -->
        <g transform="translate(20, 185)">
          <rect
            class="ent-card ent-stroke--purple"
            width="340"
            height="85"
            rx="8"
            stroke-width="1"></rect>
          <text
            x="16"
            y="24"
            class="ent-text--purple"
            font-size="12"
            font-weight="bold">2. 模組加深工作流 (Deepening Loop)</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="46" class="ent-text--body" font-size="11.5"
            >• 簡化外層參數，隱藏內部私有狀態</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="66" class="ent-text--body" font-size="11.5"
            >• 單一深模組向 N 個呼叫端提供極高槓桿</text
          >
        </g>

        <path
          d="M 190 270 L 190 290"
          class="ent-stroke--sky"
          stroke-width="1.8"
          marker-end="url(#arrow-entropy-deep)"></path>

        <!-- Step 3: Evergreen Codebase Core -->
        <g transform="translate(20, 295)">
          <rect
            class="ent-card ent-stroke--green"
            width="340"
            height="70"
            rx="8"
            stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
          <text
            x="16"
            y="24"
            class="ent-text--green"
            font-size="12"
            font-weight="bold">3. 恆常精準的代碼基底 (Evergreen Core)</text
          >
          <text x="16" y="46" class="ent-text--body" font-size="11.5"
            >✓ 小表面積、高內聚、隨時歡迎下一個 Agent</text
          >
        </g>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <div class="ent-loop__mobile">
    <div class="ent-m-group ent-m-group--red">
      <div class="ent-m-badge ent-m-badge--red">大泥球陷阱</div>
      <p class="ent-m-lead">AI 產出大量空洞包裝與轉發層</p>
      <div class="ent-m-items">
        <div class="ent-m-item ent-m-item--red">
          <strong class="ent-m-key--red">淺層模組：</strong>包裝多但沒有實質邏輯
        </div>
        <div class="ent-m-item ent-m-item--red-solid">
          ✕ 刪除測試不過，專案因無效抽象而窒息
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ent-m-group ent-m-group--sky">
      <div class="ent-m-badge ent-m-badge--sky">架構除熵迴圈</div>
      <p class="ent-m-lead">定期修剪與加深模組</p>
      <div class="ent-m-items">
        <div class="ent-m-item ent-m-item--sky">
          <strong class="ent-m-key--sky">刪除測試：</strong>砍掉無意義 Wrapper
        </div>
        <div class="ent-m-item ent-m-item--purple">
          <strong class="ent-m-key--purple">模組加深：</strong
          >收斂介面，隱藏複雜度
        </div>
        <div class="ent-m-item ent-m-item--green">
          ✓ 高槓桿、小表面積，對抗代碼庫熵增
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ent-loop {
    --ent-red: #b91c1c;
    --ent-red-title: #b91c1c;
    --ent-red-card: #fef2f2;
    --ent-red-solid: #fee2e2;
    --ent-sky: #0369a1;
    --ent-purple: #6d28d9;
    --ent-green: #047857;
    --ent-green-card: #ecfdf5;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .ent-loop {
    --ent-red: #f87171;
    --ent-red-title: #fca5a5;
    --ent-red-card: #450a0a;
    --ent-red-solid: rgba(127, 29, 29, 0.4);
    --ent-sky: #38bdf8;
    --ent-purple: #c4b5fd;
    --ent-green: #6ee7b7;
    --ent-green-card: rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.4);
  }

  .ent-loop__desktop {
    display: block;
  }

  .ent-loop__svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .ent-loop__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .ent-panel {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
  }

  .ent-grid-dot {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }

  .ent-card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
  }

  .ent-card--red {
    fill: var(--ent-red-card);
  }

  .ent-stop-red {
    stop-color: #ef4444;
  }

  .ent-stop-sky {
    stop-color: var(--ent-sky);
  }

  .ent-stroke--red {
    stroke: #ef4444;
  }

  .ent-stroke--red-soft {
    stroke: var(--ent-red);
  }

  .ent-stroke--sky {
    stroke: var(--ent-sky);
  }

  .ent-stroke--purple {
    stroke: #8b5cf6;
  }

  .ent-stroke--green {
    stroke: #10b981;
  }

  .ent-fill--red {
    fill: #ef4444;
  }

  .ent-fill--sky {
    fill: var(--ent-sky);
  }

  .ent-arrow-head--red {
    fill: #f43f5e;
  }

  .ent-arrow-head--sky {
    fill: var(--ent-sky);
  }

  .ent-text--red {
    fill: var(--ent-red);
  }

  .ent-text--red-title {
    fill: var(--ent-red-title);
  }

  .ent-text--sky {
    fill: var(--ent-sky);
  }

  .ent-text--purple {
    fill: var(--ent-purple);
  }

  .ent-text--green {
    fill: var(--ent-green);
  }

  .ent-text--muted {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .ent-text--body {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  /* 窄螢幕版 */
  .ent-m-group {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--dg-surface-2);
  }

  .ent-m-group + .ent-m-group {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .ent-m-group--red {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, #ef4444 40%, transparent);
  }

  .ent-m-group--sky {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ent-sky) 40%, transparent);
  }

  .ent-m-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
  }

  .ent-m-badge--red {
    color: var(--ent-red);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #ef4444 12%, transparent);
  }

  .ent-m-badge--sky {
    color: var(--ent-sky);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ent-sky) 12%, transparent);
  }

  .ent-m-lead {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .ent-m-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }

  .ent-m-item {
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
  }

  .ent-m-item--red,
  .ent-m-item--sky,
  .ent-m-item--purple {
    background: var(--dg-surface);
    border: 1px solid;
  }

  .ent-m-item--red {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, #ef4444 40%, transparent);
  }

  .ent-m-item--sky {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ent-sky) 40%, transparent);
  }

  .ent-m-item--purple {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, #8b5cf6 40%, transparent);
  }

  .ent-m-item--red-solid {
    background: var(--ent-red-solid);
    color: var(--ent-red);
  }

  .ent-m-item--green {
    background: var(--ent-green-card);
    color: var(--ent-green);
  }

  .ent-m-key--red {
    color: var(--ent-red-title);
  }

  .ent-m-key--sky {
    color: var(--ent-sky);
  }

  .ent-m-key--purple {
    color: var(--ent-purple);
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .ent-loop__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .ent-loop__mobile {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
</style>
